# Dependencies
## Ubuntu:
- `apt install mysql-server php php-mbstring php-curl php-json lamp-server^`

## Arch:
- Just use an inkVerb/verb VPS



# Initiating the site requires
1. All database commands must be run inside the SQL terminal.
2. updatecatids.php must be run to initiate the categories
3. Fot testing, the default partnersite must have the global subcategories added in the UI manually.
4. Listing the 12 test ads requires critical_tools/list_one_ad_testingsite.php to be re-written per each ad ID, 1-12.
5. Put the file "badad.cron" in cron as `badad` (no extension): `cp badad.cron /etc/cron.d/badad`
6. Own the cron task correctly: `chmod 0644 /etc/cron.d/badad`
7. Permissions of the directory `badad/cron` shouldn't matter

# Directories
badad located at /srv/www/badad ($badadsrvdir in config.inc)
1. webdir = badad.one
2. api = api.badad.one
3. ads = ads.badad.one
4. podcasts = podcasts.badad.one
5. media -> podcasts/media (symlink to directory above) `ln -sfn /srv/www/badad/media /srv/www/badad/podcasts/`
